# OCR benchmark corpus and its results (supabase/tools/ocr-benchmark.ts).
# NEVER commit these: the golden set is real Egyptian paperwork — bills and
# letters carrying names, amounts and account numbers — held locally only.
# The benchmark reads whatever folder it is pointed at, so nothing here needs
# to be in the repo for F18-T10 to run.
golden*/
baseline*.json

# F27-T21: the owner's device screenshots, framed by test/store/generate_store_assets.dart.
# NEVER commit them: the repo is public, and they show whatever was on the phone.
store/screenshots/raw/
